<li><strong>Cosmetics and personal care startups</strong> filling and packing their products</li>
<li><strong>Electronics and IT accessory brands</strong> repacking chargers, cables and gadgets</li>
</ul>
<p>If you import in bulk and pack into retail packs here, you need registration as <strong>both importer and packer</strong>. See our guide to <a href="/resources/blogs/lmpc-certification-for-manufacturers-and-packers-in-india">LMPC for manufacturers and packers</a>.</p>

<h2>Karnataka State or Central LMPC?</h2>
<p>You can get your LMPC certificate from either authority:</p>
<ul>
<li>the <strong>Controller of Legal Metrology, Karnataka</strong> (state)</li>
<li>the <strong>Director of Legal Metrology, Department of Consumer Affairs, Government of India</strong> (central)</li>
</ul>
