<h2>Get Your Labels Right Too</h2>
<p>Your LMPC registration goes hand in hand with correct package declarations. Each package must show the name and address of the manufacturer, packer or importer, the country of origin for imported goods, the common name of the product, the net quantity, the month and year of manufacture or import, the MRP inclusive of all taxes and consumer care details. We review your label artwork before you print or ship, so nothing is held for a missing line.</p>

